msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"The number one host club in Kamurocho right now is Stardust, no doubt about "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"But I know what's going to be the next top club, and that's where I'm gonna "
"work... I'm talking about Adam, of course!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Adam is going to rule Kamurocho not too long from now, and I plan on being "
"the number one host there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Speaking of which, do you know where it is? It's supposed to be around "
"here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "Wannabe Host"
msgstr ""
